WEBVTT

00:04:02.788 --> 00:04:06.079
Spaces can give us meaning and purpose,

00:04:06.621 --> 00:04:10.371
and just as that house inspired
Michael's dad to keep going,

00:04:10.704 --> 00:04:16.371
it also set Michael on a new path into
architecture to build structures that

00:04:16.371 --> 00:04:17.996
had the power to heal.

00:04:19.329 --> 00:04:23.288
So I'm hoping that you're going to tell me
that you go off to architecture school

00:04:23.704 --> 00:04:27.871
and they are like, welcome, we will
make all those big ideas,

00:04:28.496 --> 00:04:31.246
you will be able to build them for
people in the rest of the world.